[l_english.MODULE_CREW_3B_BONELESS]
Boneless (Mass-Production)

[l_english.MODULE_CREW_3B_BONELESS_desc]
Equipping every tank with a rubber chicken might be a genius idea, as the comical sound they make can effectively mute the roaring engine noise of the marching tanks.

[l_simp_chinese.MODULE_CREW_3B_BONELESS]
没骨头（量产型）

[l_simp_chinese.MODULE_CREW_3B_BONELESS_desc]
在每一辆坦克中都配备橡胶鸡或许是一个天才的主意，因为橡胶鸡发出的滑稽叫声可以很好的掩盖坦克行进时轰隆作响的引擎声。
